  "changes": [
    "LoadOriginalLevel subscribes/unsubscribes IEntityManager.ShowEntityFailure, scopes ActorSpawn ownership and copies error text before pooled event args are released. Synchronous FrameworkException rejections also enter FailedOriginalLevel.",
    "FailedOriginalLevel cancels pending actors/batch, hides loaded actors and stops sound; SceneLease and AssetBatch ownership remain with the production exit coordinator.",
    "Existing IUIManager/MvvmView/TextBinder/ButtonBinder/RelayCommand show a failure reason, disable Resume and keep Exit actionable. Normal pause/resume still passes.",
    "Only FirstRep-owned Pause.prefab and its generator change; no formal FPSSample asset or GUID replacements."
  ],
